{
  "slug": "lotlytics",
  "name": "Lotlytics",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Real estate market intelligence — investment scores, rental yields, and market data for 895 US metros. Free for top 50 markets.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `analyze-property` (Analyze a specific property for investment potential — provide details or paste a Zillow link), `explore-state` (Discover the best real estate investment markets in a US state — ranked by investment health score), `find-markets` (Find US real estate markets matching your investment criteria — filter by budget, rental yield, appreciation, and state), `head-to-head` (Compare two US real estate markets side-by-side — prices, yields, appreciation, migration, and a winner verdict), `market-report` (Generate a full investment report for a US real estate market — prices, rental yield, health score, and…), `portfolio-check` (Analyze 2-3 real estate markets as an investment portfolio — diversification, yield balance, and risk spread)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `lotlytics`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lotlytics@claude-community` from `daejung83/lotlytics-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
